flowchart TB
    U[Cloud Journey User] 
    UI[Cloud Journey Portal] 
    AGENT[Cloud Journey Agent] 
    DSM[Durable Journey<br/>State Machine] 
    JDB[(Cloud Journey DB)] 
    MCP[MCP Server] 
    POLICY[Tool Validation<br/>& Authorization Layer] 

    TOKEN[OAuth Token Manager] 
    SM[Secret Manager] 
    AUTH[Enterprise OAuth<br/>Authorization Server] 

    MYA[MyAccess REST API]

    AUDIT[(Audit / Observability)] 
    
    U --> UI 
    UI --> AGENT 
    
    AGENT --> DSM 
    
    DSM --> JDB 
    
    AGENT -->|MCP Tool Call| MCP 
    
    MCP --> POLICY 
    POLICY -->|Read application / owner data| JDB 
    
    POLICY --> TOKEN 
    
    TOKEN -->|Read Client Credentials| SM 
    
    TOKEN -->|Client ID + Client Secret| AUTH 
    
    AUTH -->|Short-lived Access Token| TOKEN 
    
    TOKEN -->|Bearer Token| POLICY 
    
    POLICY -->|POST Create Group| MYA 
    
    MYA -->|Master Request ID| POLICY 
    
    POLICY -->|Normalized Result| MCP 
    
    MCP --> AGENT 
    
    AGENT -->|Persist Pending State| DSM 
    
    DSM --> JDB 
    
    MCP -->|GET Request Status| MYA 
    
    MYA -->|Created / Pending / Failed| MCP 
    
    MCP --> AGENT 
    
    AGENT --> DSM

    MCP --> AUDIT 

    DSM --> AUDIT